      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلِيجَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاجَة</span>, (O, K,) i. e. <i>an oblong and
squared piece of wood of the tree called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاج</span>, <i>as
brought from India,</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سوج</span>,) <i>from
